# ============================================================================
# metal_genes.ref — metal & nutrient cycling genes (KEGG KO numbers)
# Curated for subduction-zone hot-spring metagenomes (Fe · S · N · Mn · As · H2)
# One KO per line; comment lines start with '#'.
# ============================================================================

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IRON (Fe) cycling
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Iron oxidation
K00370   # narG/nxrA  nitrate reductase / iron-related oxidoreductase
K02567   # napA  periplasmic nitrate reductase (Fe-linked)
K02568   # napB
# Iron reduction / transport
K07224   # iron-related regulator
K04759   # feoB  ferrous iron transport protein B
K04758   # feoA  ferrous iron transport protein A
K07243   # high-affinity iron transporter
K07244   # ferrous iron transport
K02016   # ABC Fe3+ transport permease
K02015   # ABC Fe3+ transport
# Magnetite / Fe storage
K02217   # ftnA  ferritin
K03594   # bfr  bacterioferritin

